  "title": "Carolina-Style \"Whole Hog\" Barbecue Pork",
  "description": "Chef John's Carolina-style \"whole hog\" barbecue pulled pork is a simplified version that requires various cuts of meat and a Dutch oven to feed a crowd.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
