  "ingredients": [
    "2.5 pounds baby back pork ribs",
    "1.75 pounds pork shoulder roast",
    "1.25 pounds pork tenderloin, trimmed",
    "1 pound pork belly, skin removed",
    "0.75 pound pork sirloin roast",
    "5 teaspoons kosher salt",
    "2 tablespoons brown sugar",
    "2 teaspoons smoked salt",
    "2 teaspoons smoked paprika",
    "2 teaspoons ground black pepper",
    "1 teaspoon ground cumin",
    "1 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "1 teaspoon onion powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon cayenne pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients and preheat the oven to 250 degrees F (120 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qc_w2AH68m-j6_-bIm40nbxFwBs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8418832-carolina-style-whole-hog-barbeque-pork-VAT-4701-Step-01-e54eb915b4f64f47b60815f33de26772.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8418832/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut ribs, pork shoulder, tenderloin, pork belly, and pork sirloin in half.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/grOHzBZI-d-TCo-WawJpBPIaVpc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8418832-carolina-style-whole-hog-barbeque-pork-VAT-4702-Step-02-25a481d451b5466ea51d538a1ab1cf1c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8418832/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine kosher salt, brown sugar, smoked salt, smoked paprika, black pepper, cumin, garlic powder, onion powder, and cayenne for dry rub in a small bowl with a spoon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-sVEq4wtzCQn3bqVX7bSOORo2fQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8418832-carolina-style-whole-hog-barbeque-pork-VAT-4705-Step-03-ee9d52665e92447a88ad6a1ed0505dd2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8418832/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season cuts of meat on both sides with dry rub; reserve about 4 teaspoons of the rub to season the cooked pork if needed after tasting.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/E0Bz8EU96ErOCz11Mt4erk94FxU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8418832-carolina-style-whole-hog-barbeque-pork-VAT-4708-Step-04-79f727a843c846769dd9dfb0893a2b18.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8418832/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a piece of heavy-duty foil on a sheet pan. Place a half of ribs down in the center of the foil; top with shoulder, tenderloin, pork belly, and sirloin. Top with other rib half.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NKTf3_KEv_aCVWI1WAXBUlL7fa8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8418832-carolina-style-whole-hog-barbeque-pork-VAT-4709-Step-05-1-07d508981c904230b6832b71aa6cd712.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8418832/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wrap tightly in 3 more layers of foil. Transfer to a Dutch oven and roast in the preheated oven until meat is falling off the bone and very, very tender, about 9 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RjirXHbquq5RMhYQGas3Z1AGhdE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8418832-carolina-style-whole-hog-barbeque-pork-VAT-4715-Step-06-4a6d2af81cf040508f6f678554141249.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8418832/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove bones and pull/shred meat before serving. All or some of the rendered fat can be mixed into the meat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6w7yJ6aA5yjdTXg-3x9WrO3uW3o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8418832-carolina-style-whole-hog-barbeque-pork-VAT-4720-Step-07-8616517121d34a67bff47c19433a43fb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8418832/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
